    "kind": "code",
    "content": "```javascript\nfunction sum(values) {\n  for (let i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {\n    if (typeof values[i] !== 'number' || isNaN(values[i])) {\n      throw new TypeError(`Invalid input at index ${i}: ${values[i]}`);\n    }\n  }\n  return values.reduce((acc, val) => acc + val, 0);\n}\nmodule.exports = sum;\n```",
    "codeExecuted": false
